== Effect ==
* Upon activation, displays one of the following messages:

{| class="wikitable" style="min-width:70%"
 | CHUB DISLIKES SMOKE!
 | Referencing the trick in which Isaac can drop a {{E|Bomb}} in front of a charging {{E|Chub}} to have her swallow it. Reference to Zelda 1 and 'DODONGO DISLIKES SMOKE'.
 |-
 | A PIECE OF PAPER IS YOUR GUIDE
 | Possibly refers to the {{t|Missing Poster}} or, the choice between {{i|The Polaroid}} and {{i|The Negative}} after defeating {{E|Mom}} or the card itself.
 |-
 | THE WALLS WILL HARDEN OVER TIME. TIME IS THE ESSENCE
 | Presumably referencing the {{r|Boss Rush}} that occurs if {{E|Mom}} is beaten in under 20 minutes, and/or the {{E|Hush}} fight that is accessible if {{E|Mom's Heart}} or {{E|It Lives!}} is beaten in under 30 minutes.
 |-
 | A DARK MARKET LIES UNDER YOUR FEET
 | Presumably referencing the secret trapdoors occasionally under rocks and the {{r|Crawl Space}} that leads Isaac to the {{r|Black Market}}, a room which sells {{r|Shop}} items for Hearts rather than Coins.
 |-
 | SOME DOORS REQUIRE A BLESSING. CARRY THEM WITH YOU
 | Refers to how to open the large golden door on {{s|Chest}} and the {{s|Dark Room}} and fight {{E|Mega Satan}}, by gathering two Key Pieces from the [[Angel]]s.
 |-
 | DENY HIS GIFTS TO ATTAIN YOUR REWARD
 | References how skipping a {{r|Devil Room}} gives the chance to gain access to the {{r|Angel Room}}.
 |-
 | SLEEPING GATEKEEPERS WILL NEED TO BE AWOKEN WITH A LOUD SOUND
 | Possibly referencing how Isaac can use bombs on the Angel statues in order to awaken them. Reference to Zelda 1.
 |-
 | ROOMS MAY YIELD MORE THAN YOU EXPECT. EXPERIMENTATION IS KEY
 | Unknown, possibly referencing {{r|Secret Room}}s or the trapdoor and bed in Isaac's room, or tinted rocks and other breakable objects.
 |}
